IL_0679: ldstr "Input"
IL_067e: ldstr "Alternate Interact Key"
IL_0683: ldc.i4.s 113
IL_0685: ldstr "Single key to use for alternative interaction instead of Shift + E
This is a single button that can be pressed instead of a button combo for alternative ineract behavior.
Dedicated button: cleaner UI, simpler controls, less keystrokes.
